      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just so quiet lately. like i spent so long trying to get away from everyone and all the noise just to finally be alone, but now that i'm actually here... it just feels heavy. like the silence is actually crushing me. i feel like i've built this perfect little cage and now i'm just stuck inside it forever.",
